  • Independently classify every rule from source and K semantics
  • Rerun Stage 4 preflight and audit hashes, obligations, and target semantics
  • If proof mode, clean-build isolated Lean copy and audit target, axioms, and bridges
  • Write evidence-backed REVIEW.md with the required final pair
