The trusted preflight now passes with the pinned Lean commit and reproduces the recorded build-output hash exactly. I also found that the Stage 4 manifest’s two generator-source hashes describe an older exporter/Klean revision than the currently mounted trusted tools. To distinguish harmless tool revision drift from payload drift, I’m regenerating Stage 4 from the frozen Stage 1/3 inputs with the current trusted exporter and will compare the complete generated tree and every semantic manifest field.
